('277','13','process_steps','7'),
('278','13','_process_steps','field_svc_process'),
('279','13','service_faq','a:14:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"How long does SEO take to show results for a Dubai business?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:322:\"<p>Most Dubai businesses see measurable keyword movement within 3 to 4 months and meaningful organic traffic growth between months 5 and 8. Highly competitive sectors such as real estate, legal, and finance may need 9 to 12 months for top positions. SEO compounds over time, unlike paid ads that stop when spend stops.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"What makes SEO in the UAE different from other markets?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:313:\"<p>UAE search mixes English and Arabic behaviour, runs on a mobile-first audience, and faces intense regional and international competition. Campaigns need local keyword data, bilingual content capability, Google Business Profile strength, and an understanding of how buyers research services across Emirates.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:32:\"How much does SEO cost in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>Professional SEO in Dubai commonly ranges from AED 3,000 to 5,000 per month for focused SME programmes to AED 15,000 to 50,000 per month for competitive enterprise work. Scope depends on site size, competition, and growth targets. <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a> for a free audit and proposal.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Do you offer SEO for Arabic language search in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:251:\"<p>Yes. Arabic SEO is a core capability. We run separate Arabic keyword research, create culturally accurate content, implement proper RTL technical setup, and pursue links from Arabic-language publications where they support visibility and trust.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"Can you guarantee first-page rankings on Google?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:263:\"<p>No ethical agency can guarantee specific rankings. Google weighs hundreds of signals. We guarantee a rigorous process, transparent reporting, and a track record of moving priority keywords into competitive positions for clients who commit to the programme.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:68:\"What is the difference between local SEO and broader commercial SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:280:\"<p>Local SEO targets city and near-me intent through Google Business Profile, citations, and location pages. Broader commercial SEO targets category and service keywords that drive enquiries nationwide. Most UAE firms need both map visibility and strong service-page rankings.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:47:\"How do you measure SEO success beyond rankings?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:238:\"<p>We track organic sessions, conversion rate, cost per lead versus paid channels, revenue or pipeline attributed to organic search, share of voice, and domain authority trends. Monthly reports connect activity to commercial outcomes.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"Do you provide SEO for ecommerce websites in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:280:\"<p>Yes. We optimise category architecture, product content, faceted navigation controls, product schema, and Core Web Vitals for shopping journeys. See our work across <a href=\"/ecommerce/\">ecommerce</a> growth programmes and related <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a>.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"What is technical SEO and why does it matter?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:258:\"<p>Technical SEO covers crawlability, indexation, site speed, mobile usability, canonicals, structured data, HTTPS, and architecture. Weak technical foundations waste content and link investment. Our audits surface the issues that block ranking capacity.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"How often will I receive reports on my SEO campaign?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:247:\"<p>You receive a monthly performance report covering rankings, traffic, conversions, acquired links, and technical health, plus access to a live Looker Studio dashboard. Enterprise clients can include weekly check-ins during the first 90 days.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Should SEO work with PPC and web development?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:240:\"<p>Yes. <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> can fund learning while organic rankings mature, and strong <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development</a> keeps technical SEO durable after launches or redesigns.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"Do you support industry-specific SEO programmes?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>We run specialist programmes for <a href=\"/real-estate/\">real estate</a>, <a href=\"/legal/\">legal</a>, <a href=\"/healthcare/\">healthcare</a>, <a href=\"/finance/\">finance</a>, <a href=\"/hospitality/\">hospitality</a>, and ecommerce brands with different compliance, intent, and conversion patterns.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"What white-hat methods do you use for link building?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:210:\"<p>We focus on digital PR, useful assets, expert commentary, and partnerships that earn editorial links. We avoid private blog networks, paid link schemes, and manipulative tactics that create ranking risk.</p>\";}i:13;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"Can you improve Google Business Profile visibility in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:202:\"<p>Yes. We optimise categories, services, photos, posts, reviews strategy, and NAP consistency so local pack visibility supports phone calls and direction requests alongside organic website traffic.</p>\";}}'),
