('282','13','_technologies','field_svc_technologies'),
('283','15','key_benefits','a:8:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Immediate visibility for high-intent buyers actively searching for your services\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Average 4.2x ROAS across our managed portfolio — every dirham working harder\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:64:\"Full account ownership — your data, your history, always yours\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Senior PPC specialists managing your campaigns — no juniors, no offshore teams\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:77:\"Comprehensive attribution tracking so you know exactly what\'s driving revenue\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:87:\"Continuous A/B testing of ads, audiences, and landing pages for compounding improvement\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Negative keyword management that eliminates budget waste on irrelevant traffic\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:76:\"Transparent monthly reporting with strategic commentary, not just data dumps\";}}'),
('284','15','_key_benefits',''),
('285','15','process_steps','7'),
('286','15','_process_steps','field_svc_process'),
('287','15','service_faq','a:13:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"How much should a Dubai business spend on Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:388:\"<p>A minimum viable budget for competitive UAE keywords is typically AED 5,000 to 10,000 per month in ad spend. Highly competitive sectors like real estate, legal, or healthcare commonly spend AED 20,000 to 50,000 or more per month. The right budget depends on industry CPC, conversion rates, and goals. We start with a cost-per-acquisition analysis so budget is driven by target ROI.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"What is ROAS and what should I target for my UAE campaign?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:314:\"<p>ROAS (Return on Ad Spend) is the revenue earned for every dirham spent. A ROAS of 4x means AED 4 earned for every AED 1 spent. For UAE ecommerce, a healthy ROAS is typically 3x to 8x depending on margins. For lead generation, we track Cost Per Lead and Cost Per Acquisition against your real profit margins.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"How long does it take for Google Ads to deliver results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:255:\"<p>Google Ads can deliver traffic from day one. Smart Bidding usually needs a 2 to 4 week learning period. By weeks 4 to 8, campaigns often operate near target efficiency. Full optimisation with statistically useful data typically takes 60 to 90 days.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Do you manage Meta Ads as well as Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:278:\"<p>Yes. We manage paid media across Google Ads (Search, Display, Shopping, Performance Max, YouTube), Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, TikTok Ads, and Snapchat Ads. For most UAE businesses we recommend Google Ads for high-intent demand capture and Meta for awareness and remarketing.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"What is remarketing and why is it important for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:351:\"<p>Remarketing shows ads to people who visited your site but did not convert. Only a small percentage of visitors convert on the first visit. Remarketing keeps your offer in front of the rest as they browse elsewhere. For high-value UAE products and long consideration cycles, remarketing often becomes one of the highest-ROAS channels in the mix.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"What is the difference between Search Ads and Performance Max?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:338:\"<p>Search Ads target keywords people actively type into Google, which makes them ideal for high-intent capture. Performance Max uses Google AI to serve ads across Search, Display, YouTube, Discover, Gmail, and Maps based on your conversion goals. We often run both: Search for control and intent, Performance Max for broader coverage.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:35:\"How do you prevent wasted ad spend?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:350:\"<p>We use deep negative keyword lists from day one, precise location and audience controls, weekly search term reviews, device and schedule bid adjustments, and disciplined match-type structure. Clients moving from self-managed accounts commonly see a 30{23b7af120707075ad9d7e9d060eb6a9825cd3c1629115f83b00d08ff575d6434} to 50{23b7af120707075ad9d7e9d060eb6a9825cd3c1629115f83b00d08ff575d6434} reduction in wasted spend within the first 30 days while holding conversion volume.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Can PPC work alongside SEO, or should I choose one?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:314:\"<p>PPC and <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">SEO</a> work best together. PPC delivers immediate visibility while SEO builds durable organic demand. As organic rankings improve, you can reduce paid spend on keywords that already win organically. PPC query data also informs SEO content priorities.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Do you offer Google Shopping Ads for UAE ecommerce?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:325:\"<p>Yes. Shopping and Performance Max Shopping are among the strongest channels for UAE ecommerce. We handle Merchant Centre setup, feed optimisation, custom labels, competitive bidding, and creative asset systems. Our ecommerce PPC work has delivered multi-x ROAS across fashion, electronics, home, and beauty categories.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"What reports will I receive on my PPC campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:289:\"<p>You receive weekly performance snapshots covering spend, clicks, conversions, CPA, and ROAS, plus a monthly strategy report with campaign analysis, search term insights, auction insights, and recommendations. You also get a live Looker Studio dashboard with real-time campaign data.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"Do you set up conversion tracking correctly for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:310:\"<p>Yes. Accurate tracking is non-negotiable. We implement Google Tag Manager, GA4 events, enhanced conversions where appropriate, CRM or call tracking for lead gen, and offline conversion imports when sales close outside the website. Without clean conversion data, Smart Bidding cannot optimise profitably.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:57:\"Can you manage YouTube and LinkedIn ads for Dubai brands?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:289:\"<p>Yes. YouTube supports mid-funnel education and remarketing at scale. LinkedIn is especially effective for B2B lead generation across professional services, finance, and enterprise sales in Dubai and Abu Dhabi. We build creative, audiences, and funnel measurement for both platforms.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:82:\"What makes SearchEngineOptimization.ae different from other PPC agencies in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:409:\"<p>We combine certified paid media specialists with local UAE market knowledge, senior account ownership, and commercial reporting tied to leads and revenue, not vanity clicks. Our team works across <a href=\"/services/\">SEO, social, and web</a> so landing pages, tracking, and creative stay aligned. Review our <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a> or <a href=\"/contact/\">request a free PPC audit</a>.</p>\";}}'),
