('1168','18','_process_steps_1_step_desc','field_proc_desc'),
('1169','18','process_steps_2_step_title','Agile Build Sprints'),
('1170','18','_process_steps_2_step_title','field_proc_title'),
('1171','18','process_steps_2_step_desc','Development proceeds in short sprints with demos, backlog control, and Git-based versioning so stakeholders can review working software continuously.'),
('1172','18','_process_steps_2_step_desc','field_proc_desc'),
('1173','18','process_steps_3_step_title','Integrations and Data Flows'),
('1174','18','_process_steps_3_step_title','field_proc_title'),
('1175','18','process_steps_3_step_desc','We connect payment gateways, CRMs, ERPs, shipping providers, and internal APIs, then validate edge cases around currency, tax, and bilingual content.'),
('1176','18','_process_steps_3_step_desc','field_proc_desc'),
('1177','18','process_steps_4_step_title','QA, Security, and Performance Testing'),
('1178','18','_process_steps_4_step_title','field_proc_title'),
('1179','18','process_steps_4_step_desc','Cross-browser checks, load scenarios, vulnerability hardening, accessibility basics, and Core Web Vitals validation happen before production cutover.'),
('1180','18','_process_steps_4_step_desc','field_proc_desc'),
('1181','18','process_steps_5_step_title','Staged Deployment and Launch'),
('1182','18','_process_steps_5_step_title','field_proc_title'),
('1183','18','process_steps_5_step_desc','We release through staging environments with caching, SSL, CDN, monitoring, and rollback plans so go-live stays controlled.'),
('1184','18','_process_steps_5_step_desc','field_proc_desc'),
('1185','18','process_steps_6_step_title','Support and Continuous Improvement'),
('1186','18','_process_steps_6_step_title','field_proc_title'),
('1187','18','process_steps_6_step_desc','After launch we monitor stability, ship improvements, and expand features as commercial priorities evolve across Dubai and wider UAE operations.'),
('1188','18','_process_steps_6_step_desc','field_proc_desc'),
('1189','18','service_faqs','14'),
('1190','18','_service_faqs','field_svc_faqs'),
('1191','18','service_faqs_0_question','What do web development services in Dubai typically include?'),
('1192','18','_service_faqs_0_question','field_faq_q'),
('1193','18','service_faqs_0_answer','<p>Professional web development services Dubai engagements usually cover architecture, custom theme or application build, integrations, performance work, security hardening, QA, deployment, and handover documentation. Many projects also include bilingual EN/AR implementation, UAE payment gateways, and post-launch maintenance so the platform stays secure and fast.</p>'),
('1194','18','_service_faqs_0_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1195','18','service_faqs_1_question','Should my business choose WordPress or a custom React application?'),
('1196','18','_service_faqs_1_question','field_faq_q'),
('1197','18','service_faqs_1_answer','<p>WordPress is the right default for most content-led Dubai business sites because editors can publish quickly and SEO foundations are strong. React or Next.js becomes valuable when you need app-like interaction, complex dashboards, or high-scale dynamic interfaces. We often recommend hybrid models when marketing pages and application views have different jobs.</p>'),
('1198','18','_service_faqs_1_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1199','18','service_faqs_2_question','Can you integrate UAE payment gateways and BNPL options?'),
('1200','18','_service_faqs_2_question','field_faq_q'),
('1201','18','service_faqs_2_answer','<p>Yes. We regularly integrate PayFort, Telr, Network International, Stripe, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and buy-now-pay-later options such as tabby and Tamara. Checkout design and technical reliability both matter, so payment work is tested across devices and failure states, not only the happy path.</p>'),
('1202','18','_service_faqs_2_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1203','18','service_faqs_3_question','How do you approach website security for UAE companies?'),
('1204','18','_service_faqs_3_question','field_faq_q'),
('1205','18','service_faqs_3_answer','<p>Security includes HTTPS enforcement, least-privilege access, hardened admin workflows, dependency updates, firewall rules, malware scanning, and backup recovery tests. Ecommerce and lead platforms get additional controls around form abuse and sensitive data handling. We also help teams operate in line with practical PDPL expectations.</p>'),
('1206','18','_service_faqs_3_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1207','18','service_faqs_4_question','What hosting setup do you recommend for Dubai traffic?'),
('1208','18','_service_faqs_4_question','field_faq_q'),
('1209','18','service_faqs_4_answer','<p>For many high-traffic platforms we favour cloud infrastructure with strong regional latency characteristics, paired with Cloudflare CDN caching. Managed WordPress hosts can be ideal for editorial sites. Where data residency matters, we evaluate UAE-compatible options. Shared hosting is avoided for revenue-critical systems.</p>'),
('1210','18','_service_faqs_4_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1211','18','service_faqs_5_question','Can you rebuild an ecommerce store without disrupting sales?'),
('1212','18','_service_faqs_5_question','field_faq_q'),
('1213','18','service_faqs_5_answer','<p>Yes, through staged migration. We clone catalogue structures, map URLs, preserve SEO metadata, test checkout thoroughly, and cut over during a controlled window. Inventory sync, payment verification, and redirect QA are non-negotiable. A careful rebuild should improve reliability rather than create downtime drama.</p>'),
('1214','18','_service_faqs_5_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1215','18','service_faqs_6_question','Do you develop Arabic and English sites with full RTL support?'),
('1216','18','_service_faqs_6_question','field_faq_q'),
('1217','18','service_faqs_6_answer','<p>Yes. Bilingual development is a core capability. We implement directional layout support, Arabic typography stacks, language-aware routing or hreflang, and CMS workflows that let teams edit each language safely. RTL bugs are caught in QA rather than discovered by customers after launch.</p>'),
('1218','18','_service_faqs_6_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1219','18','service_faqs_7_question','How long does a custom web development project take in Dubai?'),
('1220','18','_service_faqs_7_question','field_faq_q'),
('1221','18','service_faqs_7_answer','<p>A standard corporate WordPress build often lands in 6 to 10 weeks. Ecommerce platforms, multi-system integrations, or React applications commonly take 12 to 20 weeks or longer. Scope clarity, content readiness, and third-party API access are the biggest timeline variables.</p>'),
('1222','18','_service_faqs_7_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1223','18','service_faqs_8_question','How do you keep websites fast after launch?'),
('1224','18','_service_faqs_8_question','field_faq_q'),
('1225','18','service_faqs_8_answer','<p>Performance is engineered in the build through efficient queries, image strategy, caching, code splitting where relevant, and CDN delivery. After launch we monitor Core Web Vitals and regressive plugin or content changes. Fast sites stay fast only when governance exists around updates and media uploads.</p>'),
('1226','18','_service_faqs_8_answer','field_faq_a'),
