('1229','18','service_faqs_9_answer','<p>Absolutely. Clean architecture, crawlable rendering, structured data, logical internal linking, and fast pages all support organic growth. We collaborate with <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">search engine optimisation</a> and <a href=\"/services/ai-search-optimization/\">AI search optimisation</a> so technical decisions reinforce discoverability rather than fight it.</p>'),
