('1268','16','svc_benefits_json','[{\"benefit\":\"Full-service management across Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, Facebook, and YouTube\"},{\"benefit\":\"Dubai-focused content strategy aligned with UAE culture, trends, and seasonality\"},{\"benefit\":\"Professional Arabic and English content creation by bilingual specialists\"},{\"benefit\":\"Community management responding to comments, DMs, and reviews daily\"},{\"benefit\":\"Influencer marketing campaigns connecting your brand with UAE content creators\"},{\"benefit\":\"Paid social advertising including Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and TikTok Ads management\"},{\"benefit\":\"30-day content calendar with advance planning and client approval workflow\"},{\"benefit\":\"Brand voice development ensuring consistent messaging across all platforms\"},{\"benefit\":\"Competitor social analysis identifying content gaps and engagement opportunities\"},{\"benefit\":\"Monthly analytics reports tracking reach, engagement, follower growth, and leads\"}]'),
('1269','16','svc_process_json','[{\"step_title\":\"Brand and Audience Audit\",\"step_desc\":\"We analyse your current social presence, audience demographics, content performance, competitor benchmarks, and UAE market positioning to establish a baseline and find the biggest growth opportunities.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Strategy and Platform Selection\",\"step_desc\":\"Not every platform deserves equal investment. We select the right mix based on where your buyers spend time, such as Instagram for visual brands, LinkedIn for B2B, and TikTok for high-reach creative.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Content Pillars and Calendar\",\"step_desc\":\"We define 4 to 6 content pillars aligned with brand and audience needs, then build a 30-day calendar mixing educational, entertaining, and promotional content at the right frequency for each platform.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Content Creation and Production\",\"step_desc\":\"Our creative team produces platform-native Reels, Stories, carousels, short video, and written posts in English and Arabic for UAE social audiences.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Publishing and Community Management\",\"step_desc\":\"We publish at optimal UAE times, monitor comments and DMs, respond to followers, and handle reputation issues in real time so the brand stays active and trusted.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Paid Social Amplification\",\"step_desc\":\"Organic winners are boosted with targeted paid promotion, alongside dedicated campaigns for launches, lead generation, and remarketing.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Analytics and Monthly Reporting\",\"step_desc\":\"Monthly reports cover reach, engagement, follower growth, site traffic from social, leads, and paid social efficiency. Strategy evolves from that data every cycle.\"}]'),
('1270','16','svc_faqs_json','[{\"question\":\"Which social media platforms should a Dubai business focus on?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Instagram is essential for consumer brands, hospitality, and retail. LinkedIn is the priority for B2B and professional services. TikTok is critical for reaching younger audiences and earning organic reach. Facebook still supports communities and paid distribution. YouTube is strong for education and longer brand stories. We usually recommend mastering 2 to 3 platforms before expanding.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How many posts per week do I need for effective social media in Dubai?\",\"answer\":\"<p>For Instagram, plan roughly 4 to 7 feed posts per week plus daily Stories. For LinkedIn, 3 to 5 posts per week works well. For TikTok, 5 to 7 short videos per week is a strong target. Consistency beats bursts of activity. A reliable quality cadence outperforms irregular high volume.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Do you create Arabic content for UAE social media?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. Our bilingual team creates authentic Arabic and English content, not raw machine translation. Arabic creative is essential for Emirati and Arab audiences, and Arabic Reels often earn strong reach across the GCC when the tone and cultural cues are correct.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"What is influencer marketing and is it effective in the UAE?\",\"answer\":\"<p>UAE influencer collaborations can deliver strong engagement when creators match your audience and offer. Micro-influencers often outperform mega-creators on engagement and conversion efficiency. We manage talent shortlists, briefing, approvals, usage rights, and performance tracking end to end.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How do you measure social media ROI for a Dubai business?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Measurement depends on goals. Awareness tracks reach, impressions, and share of voice. Engagement tracks saves, shares, and meaningful comments. Lead generation tracks form fills and cost per lead. Ecommerce tracks tagged revenue and pixel attribution. We combine these into one monthly commercial dashboard.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"What content performs best on Instagram in the UAE?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Reels usually earn the strongest organic distribution. Practical how-to content, behind-the-scenes stories, and locally relevant lifestyle creative perform well. Interactive Stories help maintain algorithmic momentum. Visual quality matters, but clarity of offer and cultural fit matter more.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Can social media marketing generate leads and sales directly?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. Instagram and Facebook Lead Ads collect details without forcing users off-platform. LinkedIn Lead Gen Forms work well for B2B. We combine organic nurturing with paid social for measurable pipeline. Pair social with <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> when you need full-funnel coverage across search and social.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"What is TikTok potential for UAE businesses?\",\"answer\":\"<p>TikTok offers high organic upside for brands willing to create native short-form video. The algorithm can distribute strong creative beyond your follower base, which helps newer brands compete. Success depends on hooks, pacing, and cultural relevance more than polished corporate production alone.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Do you manage social media for multiple locations or franchise businesses?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. We support multi-location brands across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and other emirates with shared brand systems and localised execution. Franchise networks can keep brand consistency while each location receives relevant community management and geo-targeted paid support.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How long does it take to see results from social media marketing?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Engagement and content consistency gains often appear within 30 to 60 days. Brand lift can show earlier when creative and posting cadence improve quickly. Lead generation usually strengthens within 60 to 90 days. Paid social can generate enquiries much sooner when offers and audiences are ready. <a href=\"/contact/\">Request a free social audit</a> to map your timeline.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How do you handle UAE cultural nuance and seasonal campaigns?\",\"answer\":\"<p>We plan around Ramadan, Eid, UAE National Day, shopping festivals, tourism peaks, and sector calendars. Creative tone, timing, and offer structure change by moment. Cultural fluency also covers language choice, visual sensitivity, and community response standards.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Should social media replace SEO or Google Ads?\",\"answer\":\"<p>No. Social builds attention, trust, and demand. <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">SEO</a> captures ongoing search intent. Google Ads captures high-intent demand. The strongest UAE brands coordinate all three so awareness, consideration, and conversion reinforce each other.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"What makes your Dubai social media agency different?\",\"answer\":\"<p>We treat social as a business system: content operations, community care, paid amplification, and reporting tied to leads or bookings. Local UAE context sits at the centre, not as an afterthought. Review our <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a> or <a href=\"/about/\">learn about our team</a>.</p>\"}]'),
('1271','16','svc_technologies_json','[{\"tech_name\":\"Meta Business Suite\"},{\"tech_name\":\"Hootsuite\"},{\"tech_name\":\"Sprout Social\"},{\"tech_name\":\"Canva Pro\"},{\"tech_name\":\"Adobe Premiere Pro\"},{\"tech_name\":\"CapCut\"},{\"tech_name\":\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\"},{\"tech_name\":\"TikTok Ads Manager\"},{\"tech_name\":\"Later\"},{\"tech_name\":\"BuzzSumo\"}]'),
