('1273','17','svc_benefits_json','[{\"benefit\":\"Bespoke visual systems that reflect Dubai brand positioning without template sameness\"},{\"benefit\":\"Mobile-first layouts designed for the majority of UAE visitors browsing on smartphones\"},{\"benefit\":\"Native bilingual EN/AR design with proper RTL hierarchy and cultural adaptation\"},{\"benefit\":\"Conversion pathways engineered into every key page, not bolted on after launch\"},{\"benefit\":\"Core Web Vitals treated as a design constraint from wireframe through final UI\"},{\"benefit\":\"SEO-ready information architecture with clean heading structure and semantic markup\"},{\"benefit\":\"Luxury market aesthetics that feel premium without gimmicks or visual noise\"},{\"benefit\":\"CMS-friendly page systems so marketing teams can update content without breaking design\"},{\"benefit\":\"Landing page design aligned with paid media campaigns and commercial intent\"},{\"benefit\":\"Post-launch UX refinements guided by heatmaps, form analytics, and A/B tests\"}]'),
('1274','17','svc_process_json','[{\"step_title\":\"Discovery and Brand Workshop\",\"step_desc\":\"We clarify commercial goals, audience segments, brand cues, and the actions visitors must take. Dubai market context shapes every early decision, from tone to conversion hierarchy.\"},{\"step_title\":\"UX Research and Wireframing\",\"step_desc\":\"We map journeys from first impression to enquiry or booking. Wireframes lock structure, content priority, and CTA placement before visual craft begins.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Visual Design and Design System\",\"step_desc\":\"We craft a distinctive UI language with colour, type, spacing, and components tuned for UAE audiences. You receive a coherent system, not disconnected page mockups.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Interactive Prototype Review\",\"step_desc\":\"Figma prototypes let stakeholders click through key flows, validate bilingual layouts, and request revisions before development starts.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Design Handoff and Build Support\",\"step_desc\":\"We package specs, assets, and interaction notes for precise implementation, working closely with development so fidelity and performance stay intact.\"},{\"step_title\":\"QA Across Devices and Languages\",\"step_desc\":\"We test responsiveness, RTL behaviour, form usability, accessibility basics, and visual consistency across browsers and common UAE devices.\"},{\"step_title\":\"Launch and Conversion Tuning\",\"step_desc\":\"After go-live we review real user behaviour, refine friction points, and iterate on CTA clarity so the design keeps earning commercial results.\"}]'),
('1275','17','svc_faqs_json','[{\"question\":\"What makes web design services in Dubai different from generic global agencies?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Dubai audiences expect polished presentation, fast mobile experiences, and often bilingual English and Arabic journeys. Local competition is visually strong, so weak hierarchy or slow pages lose trust quickly. Our web design services Dubai approach blends conversion UX with market-aware aesthetics rather than exporting a generic Western template look.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How much do professional web design services cost in Dubai?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Most professional business websites fall between AED 5,000 and AED 15,000 for focused SME builds, while complex brand systems, ecommerce experiences, or multi-language platforms often range from AED 20,000 to AED 80,000 or more. Scope, page count, bilingual requirements, and custom interaction design drive pricing. We provide itemised proposals after a discovery call.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Do you design bilingual English and Arabic websites with RTL support?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. We design Arabic experiences as native RTL compositions rather than mirrored English screens. That includes Arabic typography choices, reading-pattern adjustments, CTA placement for RTL, and CMS structures that let teams manage both languages independently without breaking layout integrity.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How long does a conversion-focused website design project take?\",\"answer\":\"<p>A typical 5 to 15 page business website takes roughly 6 to 10 weeks from kickoff to launch when content is ready. Larger hospitality, real estate, or enterprise programmes can take 12 to 20 weeks. Timeline depends on decision speed, content readiness, and whether brand foundations already exist.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Will my new design hurt existing SEO rankings?\",\"answer\":\"<p>It should not if migration is planned carefully. We preserve valuable URLs where possible, map redirects for changed paths, retain meta essentials, and keep crawlable structure intact. Pairing redesign with <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">search engine optimisation</a> reduces risk and often improves visibility after launch.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How do you design for Core Web Vitals without sacrificing visual quality?\",\"answer\":\"<p>We treat performance as a design constraint. Hero media is sized and compressed intentionally, motion is purposeful rather than decorative overload, fonts are limited and loaded efficiently, and above-the-fold composition avoids layout shift. Luxury presentation and strong Core Web Vitals can coexist when design and engineering collaborate early.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Can you redesign only key pages instead of the full website?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. Many Dubai clients start with homepage, service pages, and high-intent landing pages that drive enquiries. A phased redesign can lift conversion quickly while a broader visual system rolls out over time. We still define shared components so the site stays coherent as pages are refreshed.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Do you create landing pages for Google Ads and Meta campaigns?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. We design focused landing pages with one primary offer, clear proof, and low-friction forms. Sending paid traffic to a focused page usually outperforms sending it to a general homepage. These pages work especially well alongside <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> and remarketing journeys.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"What industries do you specialise in for web design in the UAE?\",\"answer\":\"<p>We regularly design for hospitality, real estate, professional services, healthcare, ecommerce, finance, and luxury retail. Each sector has different trust cues and conversion patterns. For example, hotels need booking confidence, while clinics need clarity, credentials, and frictionless appointment pathways.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How do you measure whether a redesign is successful?\",\"answer\":\"<p>We track enquiry rate, form completion, bounce behaviour on key pages, mobile conversion share, page speed metrics, and assisted conversions from organic and paid channels. Visual polish alone is not success. Commercial lift from the same traffic volume is the real benchmark.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Will my team be able to update the site without designers?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes, when we design within a CMS-friendly system such as WordPress. Editable regions, reusable blocks, and clear component rules help marketing teams update copy and media safely. We also provide handoff guidance so day-to-day edits do not erode spacing, hierarchy, or brand consistency.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"Do you handle both design and development?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Yes. Many projects move from UX/UI into implementation through our <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development services</a>. Keeping design and build under one strategy reduces lost fidelity, performance gaps, and bilingual layout issues that often appear when teams work in isolation.</p>\"},{\"question\":\"How luxury should a Dubai website look?\",\"answer\":\"<p>Luxury in Dubai digital design usually means clarity, restraint, strong craft, and confident whitespace rather than heavy ornament. Visitors should feel quality immediately through typography, photography direction, pacing, and interaction polish. Gimmicks fade quickly. Purposeful elegance converts better and ages better.</p>\"}]'),
