('1283','13','svc_benefits','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Rank for high-intent UAE keywords that attract ready-to-buy customers\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Build a compounding organic traffic asset that grows month over month\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Reduce cost per acquisition by up to 80{23b7af120707075ad9d7e9d060eb6a9825cd3c1629115f83b00d08ff575d6434} versus paid advertising channels\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Capture featured snippets, People Also Ask, and local pack placements\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:69:\"Full technical SEO covering crawl health, Core Web Vitals, and schema\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:66:\"Bilingual keyword research for English and Arabic search behaviour\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Authority link building from UAE publications and relevant industry sites\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Local SEO and Google Business Profile optimisation for map rankings\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:63:\"Monthly reporting tied to leads, pipeline, and revenue outcomes\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"E-E-A-T strengthening so Google trusts your brand across the domain\";}}'),
('1284','13','svc_process','a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Discovery and Business Analysis\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:138:\"We study your offer, buyers, competitors, and revenue goals so the SEO plan targets commercial outcomes rather than vanity rankings alone.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Technical and Competitive Audit\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:161:\"A deep technical review finds crawl barriers, indexation waste, and site architecture issues while we reverse-engineer competitors winning your priority queries.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:37:\"Keyword Research and Content Strategy\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:141:\"We map English and Arabic demand, cluster topics by intent, and prioritise quick wins alongside durable authority pages for long-term growth.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:24:\"Technical Implementation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:147:\"Developers fix Core Web Vitals, crawl paths, canonicals, schema, and structural issues that block ranking potential before content and links scale.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:33:\"Content Creation and Optimisation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:141:\"We produce and refine pages that answer buyer questions clearly, support E-E-A-T, and earn snippets while remaining useful for human readers.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Link Building and Digital PR\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:145:\"We earn relevant, contextual backlinks from UAE and sector publications through outreach and newsworthy assets that strengthen topical authority.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:29:\"Reporting and Strategy Review\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:147:\"Live dashboards, monthly performance reviews, and quarterly planning keep rankings, traffic, leads, and revenue attribution visible and actionable.\";}}'),
('1285','13','svc_faqs','a:14:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"How long does SEO take to show results for a Dubai business?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:322:\"<p>Most Dubai businesses see measurable keyword movement within 3 to 4 months and meaningful organic traffic growth between months 5 and 8. Highly competitive sectors such as real estate, legal, and finance may need 9 to 12 months for top positions. SEO compounds over time, unlike paid ads that stop when spend stops.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"What makes SEO in the UAE different from other markets?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:313:\"<p>UAE search mixes English and Arabic behaviour, runs on a mobile-first audience, and faces intense regional and international competition. Campaigns need local keyword data, bilingual content capability, Google Business Profile strength, and an understanding of how buyers research services across Emirates.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:32:\"How much does SEO cost in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>Professional SEO in Dubai commonly ranges from AED 3,000 to 5,000 per month for focused SME programmes to AED 15,000 to 50,000 per month for competitive enterprise work. Scope depends on site size, competition, and growth targets. <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a> for a free audit and proposal.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Do you offer SEO for Arabic language search in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:251:\"<p>Yes. Arabic SEO is a core capability. We run separate Arabic keyword research, create culturally accurate content, implement proper RTL technical setup, and pursue links from Arabic-language publications where they support visibility and trust.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"Can you guarantee first-page rankings on Google?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:263:\"<p>No ethical agency can guarantee specific rankings. Google weighs hundreds of signals. We guarantee a rigorous process, transparent reporting, and a track record of moving priority keywords into competitive positions for clients who commit to the programme.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:68:\"What is the difference between local SEO and broader commercial SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:280:\"<p>Local SEO targets city and near-me intent through Google Business Profile, citations, and location pages. Broader commercial SEO targets category and service keywords that drive enquiries nationwide. Most UAE firms need both map visibility and strong service-page rankings.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:47:\"How do you measure SEO success beyond rankings?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:238:\"<p>We track organic sessions, conversion rate, cost per lead versus paid channels, revenue or pipeline attributed to organic search, share of voice, and domain authority trends. Monthly reports connect activity to commercial outcomes.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"Do you provide SEO for ecommerce websites in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:280:\"<p>Yes. We optimise category architecture, product content, faceted navigation controls, product schema, and Core Web Vitals for shopping journeys. See our work across <a href=\"/ecommerce/\">ecommerce</a> growth programmes and related <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a>.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"What is technical SEO and why does it matter?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:258:\"<p>Technical SEO covers crawlability, indexation, site speed, mobile usability, canonicals, structured data, HTTPS, and architecture. Weak technical foundations waste content and link investment. Our audits surface the issues that block ranking capacity.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"How often will I receive reports on my SEO campaign?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:247:\"<p>You receive a monthly performance report covering rankings, traffic, conversions, acquired links, and technical health, plus access to a live Looker Studio dashboard. Enterprise clients can include weekly check-ins during the first 90 days.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Should SEO work with PPC and web development?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:240:\"<p>Yes. <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> can fund learning while organic rankings mature, and strong <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development</a> keeps technical SEO durable after launches or redesigns.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"Do you support industry-specific SEO programmes?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>We run specialist programmes for <a href=\"/real-estate/\">real estate</a>, <a href=\"/legal/\">legal</a>, <a href=\"/healthcare/\">healthcare</a>, <a href=\"/finance/\">finance</a>, <a href=\"/hospitality/\">hospitality</a>, and ecommerce brands with different compliance, intent, and conversion patterns.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"What white-hat methods do you use for link building?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:210:\"<p>We focus on digital PR, useful assets, expert commentary, and partnerships that earn editorial links. We avoid private blog networks, paid link schemes, and manipulative tactics that create ranking risk.</p>\";}i:13;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"Can you improve Google Business Profile visibility in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:202:\"<p>Yes. We optimise categories, services, photos, posts, reviews strategy, and NAP consistency so local pack visibility supports phone calls and direction requests alongside organic website traffic.</p>\";}}'),
('1286','13','svc_technologies','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"Ahrefs\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"SEMrush\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:21:\"Google Search Console\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"Screaming Frog\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Analytics 4\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Surfer SEO\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"Majestic\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"PageSpeed Insights\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Looker Studio\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"BrightEdge\";}}'),
('1287','13','svc_related','a:2:{i:0;i:15;i:1;i:14;}'),
('1288','15','svc_benefits','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:81:\"Immediate first-page visibility from day one with no waiting for organic rankings\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Precision audience targeting by location, device, time, demographics, and intent\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:82:\"Full Google Ads account audit identifying wasted spend and quick-win optimisations\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:68:\"Conversion-focused landing page strategy to maximise ad spend return\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Smart Bidding with AI-powered automated strategies tailored to your goals\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Remarketing campaigns re-engaging website visitors across Google Display Network\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Competitive conquest campaigns targeting competitor brand keywords in Dubai\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Shopping and Performance Max campaigns for UAE ecommerce businesses\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and TikTok Ads management for full-funnel coverage\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:72:\"Weekly optimisation cycles with transparent revenue-attributed reporting\";}}'),
('1289','15','svc_process','a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:37:\"Account Audit and Competitor Research\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:207:\"We audit your existing Google Ads account to identify wasted spend, missing keywords, poor Quality Scores, and immediate improvement opportunities, or analyse competitor strategies if you are starting fresh.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Campaign Strategy and Structure\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:163:\"We architect a clean campaign structure segmented by service, product, location, and intent so Google can reward your account with lower CPCs and stronger Ad Rank.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:35:\"Keyword Research and Negative Lists\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:172:\"Comprehensive keyword research across match types, paired with exhaustive negative keyword lists, ensures your budget reaches genuine buyers instead of irrelevant searches.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:33:\"Ad Copy and Landing Page Creation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:167:\"Our copywriters create high-CTR ads with clear USPs and calls to action. We build or refine conversion-focused landing pages that turn clicks into enquiries and sales.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:34:\"Bid Strategy and Budget Allocation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:174:\"We configure Smart Bidding strategies such as Target CPA, Target ROAS, or Maximise Conversions, calibrated to your goals and historical data for efficient spend from day one.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:23:\"Continuous Optimisation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:159:\"Weekly optimisation cycles adjust bids, pause weak ads, test new creatives, expand keyword coverage, and refine audiences to improve performance and cut waste.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Reporting and Strategic Reviews\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:171:\"Weekly snapshots and monthly strategy reports cover impressions, clicks, conversions, CPA, ROAS, and revenue. Quarterly reviews keep campaigns aligned with business goals.\";}}'),
('1290','15','svc_faqs','a:13:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:53:\"How much should a Dubai business spend on Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:388:\"<p>A minimum viable budget for competitive UAE keywords is typically AED 5,000 to 10,000 per month in ad spend. Highly competitive sectors like real estate, legal, or healthcare commonly spend AED 20,000 to 50,000 or more per month. The right budget depends on industry CPC, conversion rates, and goals. We start with a cost-per-acquisition analysis so budget is driven by target ROI.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"What is ROAS and what should I target for my UAE campaign?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:314:\"<p>ROAS (Return on Ad Spend) is the revenue earned for every dirham spent. A ROAS of 4x means AED 4 earned for every AED 1 spent. For UAE ecommerce, a healthy ROAS is typically 3x to 8x depending on margins. For lead generation, we track Cost Per Lead and Cost Per Acquisition against your real profit margins.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"How long does it take for Google Ads to deliver results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:255:\"<p>Google Ads can deliver traffic from day one. Smart Bidding usually needs a 2 to 4 week learning period. By weeks 4 to 8, campaigns often operate near target efficiency. Full optimisation with statistically useful data typically takes 60 to 90 days.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"Do you manage Meta Ads as well as Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:278:\"<p>Yes. We manage paid media across Google Ads (Search, Display, Shopping, Performance Max, YouTube), Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, TikTok Ads, and Snapchat Ads. For most UAE businesses we recommend Google Ads for high-intent demand capture and Meta for awareness and remarketing.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"What is remarketing and why is it important for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:351:\"<p>Remarketing shows ads to people who visited your site but did not convert. Only a small percentage of visitors convert on the first visit. Remarketing keeps your offer in front of the rest as they browse elsewhere. For high-value UAE products and long consideration cycles, remarketing often becomes one of the highest-ROAS channels in the mix.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"What is the difference between Search Ads and Performance Max?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:338:\"<p>Search Ads target keywords people actively type into Google, which makes them ideal for high-intent capture. Performance Max uses Google AI to serve ads across Search, Display, YouTube, Discover, Gmail, and Maps based on your conversion goals. We often run both: Search for control and intent, Performance Max for broader coverage.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:35:\"How do you prevent wasted ad spend?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:350:\"<p>We use deep negative keyword lists from day one, precise location and audience controls, weekly search term reviews, device and schedule bid adjustments, and disciplined match-type structure. Clients moving from self-managed accounts commonly see a 30{23b7af120707075ad9d7e9d060eb6a9825cd3c1629115f83b00d08ff575d6434} to 50{23b7af120707075ad9d7e9d060eb6a9825cd3c1629115f83b00d08ff575d6434} reduction in wasted spend within the first 30 days while holding conversion volume.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Can PPC work alongside SEO, or should I choose one?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:314:\"<p>PPC and <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">SEO</a> work best together. PPC delivers immediate visibility while SEO builds durable organic demand. As organic rankings improve, you can reduce paid spend on keywords that already win organically. PPC query data also informs SEO content priorities.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Do you offer Google Shopping Ads for UAE ecommerce?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:325:\"<p>Yes. Shopping and Performance Max Shopping are among the strongest channels for UAE ecommerce. We handle Merchant Centre setup, feed optimisation, custom labels, competitive bidding, and creative asset systems. Our ecommerce PPC work has delivered multi-x ROAS across fashion, electronics, home, and beauty categories.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:48:\"What reports will I receive on my PPC campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:289:\"<p>You receive weekly performance snapshots covering spend, clicks, conversions, CPA, and ROAS, plus a monthly strategy report with campaign analysis, search term insights, auction insights, and recommendations. You also get a live Looker Studio dashboard with real-time campaign data.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"Do you set up conversion tracking correctly for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:310:\"<p>Yes. Accurate tracking is non-negotiable. We implement Google Tag Manager, GA4 events, enhanced conversions where appropriate, CRM or call tracking for lead gen, and offline conversion imports when sales close outside the website. Without clean conversion data, Smart Bidding cannot optimise profitably.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:57:\"Can you manage YouTube and LinkedIn ads for Dubai brands?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:289:\"<p>Yes. YouTube supports mid-funnel education and remarketing at scale. LinkedIn is especially effective for B2B lead generation across professional services, finance, and enterprise sales in Dubai and Abu Dhabi. We build creative, audiences, and funnel measurement for both platforms.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:82:\"What makes SearchEngineOptimization.ae different from other PPC agencies in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:409:\"<p>We combine certified paid media specialists with local UAE market knowledge, senior account ownership, and commercial reporting tied to leads and revenue, not vanity clicks. Our team works across <a href=\"/services/\">SEO, social, and web</a> so landing pages, tracking, and creative stay aligned. Review our <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a> or <a href=\"/contact/\">request a free PPC audit</a>.</p>\";}}'),
('1291','15','svc_technologies','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Google Ads\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:16:\"Meta Ads Manager\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Analytics 4\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:22:\"Google Merchant Centre\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Looker Studio\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"SEMrush\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:25:\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"TikTok Ads Manager\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Tag Manager\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Optmyzr\";}}'),
('1292','15','svc_related','a:2:{i:0;i:13;i:1;i:16;}'),
('1293','14','svc_benefits','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:63:\"Appear in Google AI Overviews for high-value commercial queries\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:63:\"Earn citations in ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, and Bing Copilot\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:65:\"Strengthen-based SEO that strengthens Knowledge Graph recognition\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:56:\"Structured data designed for machine-readable extraction\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:63:\"E-E-A-T systems that signal expertise AI models prefer to trust\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Snippet and People Also Ask ownership that feeds generative answers\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:60:\"Conversational content mapped to natural language AI queries\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:63:\"Brand mention and PR programmes that amplify citation authority\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:61:\"Voice and assistant-ready answers for UAE bilingual audiences\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:61:\"Monthly AI visibility tracking across overviews and citations\";}}');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` (`meta_id`,`post_id`,`meta_key`,`meta_value`) VALUES
('1294','14','svc_process','a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"AI Search Landscape Analysis\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:147:\"We identify which AI surfaces influence your category, which competitor pages get cited, and which content formats generative engines reward today.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:32:\"Entity and Knowledge Graph Audit\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:145:\"We assess brand entity presence across Knowledge Panels, Wikidata, directories, and publications, then close gaps that block trusted recognition.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:33:\"Content Architecture for Citation\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:143:\"Key pages are restructured with clear definitions, evidence blocks, comparison tables, and extractable answers AI systems can quote accurately.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:34:\"Schema and Machine-Readable Markup\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:142:\"We implement Organisation, Service, FAQ, HowTo, Article, and Person schema so crawlers and models understand entities, authorship, and offers.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:39:\"Authority and Citation Network Building\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:140:\"Digital PR, expert commentary, and authoritative placements expand the external corroboration generative engines use when selecting sources.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:43:\"Conversational and Bilingual Answer Content\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:136:\"We create English and Arabic answer assets that match how UAE buyers ask AI assistants about services, comparisons, and local providers.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:27:\"Monitor, Measure, and Adapt\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:140:\"Monthly sampling tracks AI Overview appearances, citation frequency, and competitor share of voice so strategy evolves with model behaviour.\";}}'),
('1295','14','svc_faqs','a:14:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"What is Google AI Overviews and how do I appear in them?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:291:\"<p>Google AI Overviews are generative summaries at the top of many search results. Pages that earn citations tend to already rank well, present clear answers, demonstrate E-E-A-T, and use structured formats machines can parse. Entity clarity and consistent brand corroboration also help.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"What is GEO (Generative Engine Optimisation)?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:262:\"<p>GEO is the practice of earning citations and recommendations inside generative engines such as ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Copilot. It prioritises trust, comprehensiveness, entity strength, and extractable answers rather than blue-link ranking alone.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Does AI search reduce the value of traditional SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:276:\"<p>No. Strong organic rankings remain a major citation source for AI Overviews. AI search changes click patterns on some queries, so brands need both classic <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">search engine optimisation</a> and generative visibility planning.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"Which AI platforms should UAE businesses prioritise?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:261:\"<p>Start with Google AI Overviews for volume, then Perplexity for research-led B2B journeys, ChatGPT with browsing for broad consumer and professional use, Bing Copilot for Microsoft-centric workplaces, and Gemini where Google ecosystems dominate discovery.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"What is entity SEO and why does it matter for AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:252:\"<p>Entity SEO builds a consistent machine-readable identity for your brand, people, services, and locations. Generative systems rely on entity relationships when deciding whom to trust. Weak or conflicting entity signals reduce citation likelihood.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"How do you measure AI search optimisation success?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:239:\"<p>We track AI Overview appearances for target queries, citation frequency in sampled AI answers, Knowledge Panel completeness, featured snippet ownership, brand mention velocity, and referral traffic from AI platforms where available.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"Do I need Arabic content for AI search in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:224:\"<p>Yes for many categories. Arabic assistant queries need Arabic authoritative sources to cite. We produce bilingual answer content with correct hreflang and pursue Arabic publication mentions that corroborate expertise.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"How is AI SEO different from traditional SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:266:\"<p>Traditional SEO emphasises crawl signals, keywords, links, and ranking positions. AI SEO emphasises citation-worthiness: factual density, clear authorship, structured answers, corroborating mentions, and topical completeness that models can synthesise safely.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"What role does schema markup play in AIO visibility?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:233:\"<p>Schema clarifies organisations, people, services, FAQs, and how-to steps. It does not guarantee citations, but it reduces ambiguity for crawlers and supports rich results that often correlate with extractable, trusted content.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"How quickly can AI search optimisation show results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:262:\"<p>Extractability improvements and snippet wins can appear within 4 to 8 weeks. Consistent Overview and multi-engine citation presence usually takes 3 to 6 months of entity, content, and authority work. Early movers in the UAE still face lighter competition.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"Can AI visibility support lead generation alongside SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:285:\"<p>Yes. When AI answers cite your brand, prospects arrive with higher trust and clearer intent. We align citation pages with enquiry paths and often support demand capture through <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> while organic and generative coverage expands.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Do you work with regulated UAE industries on AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:224:\"<p>Yes. We adapt claims, evidence, and author signals for <a href=\"/healthcare/\">healthcare</a>, <a href=\"/legal/\">legal</a>, and <a href=\"/finance/\">finance</a> so citation-worthy content remains compliant and credible.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:59:\"Should website design and development change for AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:282:\"<p>Often yes. Clear information architecture, fast templates, and stable URLs help both crawlers and users. We collaborate with <a href=\"/services/web-design/\">web design</a> and <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development</a> when structure blocks extractable answers.</p>\";}i:13;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:54:\"How do we get started with an AI visibility programme?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:220:\"<p><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a> for an AI search visibility review. We sample target queries across major engines, score citation gaps, and propose a prioritised GEO and AIO roadmap for your Dubai or UAE brand.</p>\";}}'),
('1296','14','svc_technologies','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Search Labs\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Perplexity AI\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"ChatGPT Search\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Schema.org\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:21:\"Google Search Console\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"Ahrefs\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Brand24\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:10:\"Surfer SEO\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:26:\"Google Knowledge Graph API\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"Screaming Frog\";}}'),
('1297','14','svc_related','a:2:{i:0;i:13;i:1;i:15;}'),
('1298','16','svc_benefits','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:81:\"Full-service management across Instagram, LinkedIn, TikTok, Facebook, and YouTube\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Dubai-focused content strategy aligned with UAE culture, trends, and seasonality\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:73:\"Professional Arabic and English content creation by bilingual specialists\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:67:\"Community management responding to comments, DMs, and reviews daily\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Influencer marketing campaigns connecting your brand with UAE content creators\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"Paid social advertising including Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and TikTok Ads management\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"30-day content calendar with advance planning and client approval workflow\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:74:\"Brand voice development ensuring consistent messaging across all platforms\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Competitor social analysis identifying content gaps and engagement opportunities\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:80:\"Monthly analytics reports tracking reach, engagement, follower growth, and leads\";}}'),
('1299','16','svc_process','a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:24:\"Brand and Audience Audit\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:201:\"We analyse your current social presence, audience demographics, content performance, competitor benchmarks, and UAE market positioning to establish a baseline and find the biggest growth opportunities.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Strategy and Platform Selection\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:199:\"Not every platform deserves equal investment. We select the right mix based on where your buyers spend time, such as Instagram for visual brands, LinkedIn for B2B, and TikTok for high-reach creative.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Content Pillars and Calendar\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:200:\"We define 4 to 6 content pillars aligned with brand and audience needs, then build a 30-day calendar mixing educational, entertaining, and promotional content at the right frequency for each platform.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Content Creation and Production\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:148:\"Our creative team produces platform-native Reels, Stories, carousels, short video, and written posts in English and Arabic for UAE social audiences.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:35:\"Publishing and Community Management\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:161:\"We publish at optimal UAE times, monitor comments and DMs, respond to followers, and handle reputation issues in real time so the brand stays active and trusted.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:25:\"Paid Social Amplification\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:135:\"Organic winners are boosted with targeted paid promotion, alongside dedicated campaigns for launches, lead generation, and remarketing.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Analytics and Monthly Reporting\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:163:\"Monthly reports cover reach, engagement, follower growth, site traffic from social, leads, and paid social efficiency. Strategy evolves from that data every cycle.\";}}'),
('1300','16','svc_faqs','a:13:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"Which social media platforms should a Dubai business focus on?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:395:\"<p>Instagram is essential for consumer brands, hospitality, and retail. LinkedIn is the priority for B2B and professional services. TikTok is critical for reaching younger audiences and earning organic reach. Facebook still supports communities and paid distribution. YouTube is strong for education and longer brand stories. We usually recommend mastering 2 to 3 platforms before expanding.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:70:\"How many posts per week do I need for effective social media in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:290:\"<p>For Instagram, plan roughly 4 to 7 feed posts per week plus daily Stories. For LinkedIn, 3 to 5 posts per week works well. For TikTok, 5 to 7 short videos per week is a strong target. Consistency beats bursts of activity. A reliable quality cadence outperforms irregular high volume.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"Do you create Arabic content for UAE social media?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:267:\"<p>Yes. Our bilingual team creates authentic Arabic and English content, not raw machine translation. Arabic creative is essential for Emirati and Arab audiences, and Arabic Reels often earn strong reach across the GCC when the tone and cultural cues are correct.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"What is influencer marketing and is it effective in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:302:\"<p>UAE influencer collaborations can deliver strong engagement when creators match your audience and offer. Micro-influencers often outperform mega-creators on engagement and conversion efficiency. We manage talent shortlists, briefing, approvals, usage rights, and performance tracking end to end.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:57:\"How do you measure social media ROI for a Dubai business?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:315:\"<p>Measurement depends on goals. Awareness tracks reach, impressions, and share of voice. Engagement tracks saves, shares, and meaningful comments. Lead generation tracks form fills and cost per lead. Ecommerce tracks tagged revenue and pixel attribution. We combine these into one monthly commercial dashboard.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"What content performs best on Instagram in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:299:\"<p>Reels usually earn the strongest organic distribution. Practical how-to content, behind-the-scenes stories, and locally relevant lifestyle creative perform well. Interactive Stories help maintain algorithmic momentum. Visual quality matters, but clarity of offer and cultural fit matter more.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:61:\"Can social media marketing generate leads and sales directly?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:342:\"<p>Yes. Instagram and Facebook Lead Ads collect details without forcing users off-platform. LinkedIn Lead Gen Forms work well for B2B. We combine organic nurturing with paid social for measurable pipeline. Pair social with <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> when you need full-funnel coverage across search and social.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:44:\"What is TikTok potential for UAE businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:304:\"<p>TikTok offers high organic upside for brands willing to create native short-form video. The algorithm can distribute strong creative beyond your follower base, which helps newer brands compete. Success depends on hooks, pacing, and cultural relevance more than polished corporate production alone.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:74:\"Do you manage social media for multiple locations or franchise businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:284:\"<p>Yes. We support multi-location brands across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, and other emirates with shared brand systems and localised execution. Franchise networks can keep brand consistency while each location receives relevant community management and geo-targeted paid support.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:65:\"How long does it take to see results from social media marketing?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:377:\"<p>Engagement and content consistency gains often appear within 30 to 60 days. Brand lift can show earlier when creative and posting cadence improve quickly. Lead generation usually strengthens within 60 to 90 days. Paid social can generate enquiries much sooner when offers and audiences are ready. <a href=\"/contact/\">Request a free social audit</a> to map your timeline.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:61:\"How do you handle UAE cultural nuance and seasonal campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:271:\"<p>We plan around Ramadan, Eid, UAE National Day, shopping festivals, tourism peaks, and sector calendars. Creative tone, timing, and offer structure change by moment. Cultural fluency also covers language choice, visual sensitivity, and community response standards.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:46:\"Should social media replace SEO or Google Ads?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:294:\"<p>No. Social builds attention, trust, and demand. <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">SEO</a> captures ongoing search intent. Google Ads captures high-intent demand. The strongest UAE brands coordinate all three so awareness, consideration, and conversion reinforce each other.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"What makes your Dubai social media agency different?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>We treat social as a business system: content operations, community care, paid amplification, and reporting tied to leads or bookings. Local UAE context sits at the centre, not as an afterthought. Review our <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a> or <a href=\"/about/\">learn about our team</a>.</p>\";}}'),
('1301','16','svc_technologies','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:19:\"Meta Business Suite\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"Hootsuite\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Sprout Social\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"Canva Pro\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Adobe Premiere Pro\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"CapCut\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:25:\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"TikTok Ads Manager\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"Later\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"BuzzSumo\";}}'),
('1302','16','svc_related','a:2:{i:0;i:15;i:1;i:13;}'),
('1303','17','svc_benefits','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:85:\"Bespoke visual systems that reflect Dubai brand positioning without template sameness\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:86:\"Mobile-first layouts designed for the majority of UAE visitors browsing on smartphones\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:79:\"Native bilingual EN/AR design with proper RTL hierarchy and cultural adaptation\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Conversion pathways engineered into every key page, not bolted on after launch\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:78:\"Core Web Vitals treated as a design constraint from wireframe through final UI\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"SEO-ready information architecture with clean heading structure and semantic markup\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Luxury market aesthetics that feel premium without gimmicks or visual noise\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:87:\"CMS-friendly page systems so marketing teams can update content without breaking design\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:75:\"Landing page design aligned with paid media campaigns and commercial intent\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:76:\"Post-launch UX refinements guided by heatmaps, form analytics, and A/B tests\";}}'),
('1304','17','svc_process','a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Discovery and Brand Workshop\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:180:\"We clarify commercial goals, audience segments, brand cues, and the actions visitors must take. Dubai market context shapes every early decision, from tone to conversion hierarchy.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:27:\"UX Research and Wireframing\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:151:\"We map journeys from first impression to enquiry or booking. Wireframes lock structure, content priority, and CTA placement before visual craft begins.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"Visual Design and Design System\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:164:\"We craft a distinctive UI language with colour, type, spacing, and components tuned for UAE audiences. You receive a coherent system, not disconnected page mockups.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Interactive Prototype Review\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:135:\"Figma prototypes let stakeholders click through key flows, validate bilingual layouts, and request revisions before development starts.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:32:\"Design Handoff and Build Support\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:149:\"We package specs, assets, and interaction notes for precise implementation, working closely with development so fidelity and performance stay intact.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:31:\"QA Across Devices and Languages\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:139:\"We test responsiveness, RTL behaviour, form usability, accessibility basics, and visual consistency across browsers and common UAE devices.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Launch and Conversion Tuning\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:143:\"After go-live we review real user behaviour, refine friction points, and iterate on CTA clarity so the design keeps earning commercial results.\";}}'),
('1305','17','svc_faqs','a:13:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:79:\"What makes web design services in Dubai different from generic global agencies?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:360:\"<p>Dubai audiences expect polished presentation, fast mobile experiences, and often bilingual English and Arabic journeys. Local competition is visually strong, so weak hierarchy or slow pages lose trust quickly. Our web design services Dubai approach blends conversion UX with market-aware aesthetics rather than exporting a generic Western template look.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:59:\"How much do professional web design services cost in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:377:\"<p>Most professional business websites fall between AED 5,000 and AED 15,000 for focused SME builds, while complex brand systems, ecommerce experiences, or multi-language platforms often range from AED 20,000 to AED 80,000 or more. Scope, page count, bilingual requirements, and custom interaction design drive pricing. We provide itemised proposals after a discovery call.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:69:\"Do you design bilingual English and Arabic websites with RTL support?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>Yes. We design Arabic experiences as native RTL compositions rather than mirrored English screens. That includes Arabic typography choices, reading-pattern adjustments, CTA placement for RTL, and CMS structures that let teams manage both languages independently without breaking layout integrity.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"How long does a conversion-focused website design project take?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:303:\"<p>A typical 5 to 15 page business website takes roughly 6 to 10 weeks from kickoff to launch when content is ready. Larger hospitality, real estate, or enterprise programmes can take 12 to 20 weeks. Timeline depends on decision speed, content readiness, and whether brand foundations already exist.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:46:\"Will my new design hurt existing SEO rankings?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:349:\"<p>It should not if migration is planned carefully. We preserve valuable URLs where possible, map redirects for changed paths, retain meta essentials, and keep crawlable structure intact. Pairing redesign with <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">search engine optimisation</a> reduces risk and often improves visibility after launch.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:73:\"How do you design for Core Web Vitals without sacrificing visual quality?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:355:\"<p>We treat performance as a design constraint. Hero media is sized and compressed intentionally, motion is purposeful rather than decorative overload, fonts are limited and loaded efficiently, and above-the-fold composition avoids layout shift. Luxury presentation and strong Core Web Vitals can coexist when design and engineering collaborate early.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"Can you redesign only key pages instead of the full website?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:300:\"<p>Yes. Many Dubai clients start with homepage, service pages, and high-intent landing pages that drive enquiries. A phased redesign can lift conversion quickly while a broader visual system rolls out over time. We still define shared components so the site stays coherent as pages are refreshed.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"Do you create landing pages for Google Ads and Meta campaigns?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:321:\"<p>Yes. We design focused landing pages with one primary offer, clear proof, and low-friction forms. Sending paid traffic to a focused page usually outperforms sending it to a general homepage. These pages work especially well alongside <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> and remarketing journeys.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"What industries do you specialise in for web design in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:317:\"<p>We regularly design for hospitality, real estate, professional services, healthcare, ecommerce, finance, and luxury retail. Each sector has different trust cues and conversion patterns. For example, hotels need booking confidence, while clinics need clarity, credentials, and frictionless appointment pathways.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"How do you measure whether a redesign is successful?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:283:\"<p>We track enquiry rate, form completion, bounce behaviour on key pages, mobile conversion share, page speed metrics, and assisted conversions from organic and paid channels. Visual polish alone is not success. Commercial lift from the same traffic volume is the real benchmark.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"Will my team be able to update the site without designers?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:294:\"<p>Yes, when we design within a CMS-friendly system such as WordPress. Editable regions, reusable blocks, and clear component rules help marketing teams update copy and media safely. We also provide handoff guidance so day-to-day edits do not erode spacing, hierarchy, or brand consistency.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:42:\"Do you handle both design and development?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:301:\"<p>Yes. Many projects move from UX/UI into implementation through our <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development services</a>. Keeping design and build under one strategy reduces lost fidelity, performance gaps, and bilingual layout issues that often appear when teams work in isolation.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:39:\"How luxury should a Dubai website look?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:330:\"<p>Luxury in Dubai digital design usually means clarity, restraint, strong craft, and confident whitespace rather than heavy ornament. Visitors should feel quality immediately through typography, photography direction, pacing, and interaction polish. Gimmicks fade quickly. Purposeful elegance converts better and ages better.</p>\";}}'),
('1306','17','svc_technologies','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"Figma\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:20:\"Adobe Creative Suite\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"WordPress\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Elementor Pro\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Webflow\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:6:\"Hotjar\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:25:\"Google PageSpeed Insights\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"GTmetrix\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"Google Tag Manager\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:13:\"Looker Studio\";}}'),
('1307','17','svc_related','a:2:{i:0;i:18;i:1;i:13;}'),
('1308','18','svc_benefits','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"Custom WordPress themes, plugins, and workflows tailored to how your team publishes\";}i:1;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:87:\"React and Next.js builds for dynamic product experiences and high-interaction platforms\";}i:2;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"WooCommerce and custom ecommerce architecture ready for UAE catalogues and checkout\";}i:3;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:85:\"Local payment integrations including PayFort, Telr, Network International, and Stripe\";}i:4;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"API connections to CRM, ERP, shipping, accounting, and marketing automation systems\";}i:5;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:89:\"Performance engineering aimed at strong Core Web Vitals under real UAE network conditions\";}i:6;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:83:\"Security hardening aligned with practical PDPL and commercial data-protection needs\";}i:7;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:85:\"Hosting and CDN choices suited to latency, uptime, and regional compliance priorities\";}i:8;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:84:\"Arabic and English technical implementation with reliable RTL behaviour across views\";}i:9;a:1:{s:7:\"benefit\";s:87:\"Maintenance retainers covering updates, monitoring, backups, and iterative feature work\";}}'),
('1309','18','svc_process','a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:36:\"Technical Discovery and Architecture\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:174:\"We document functional requirements, integrations, traffic expectations, security needs, and content operations. Architecture decisions are made before code volume increases.\";}i:1;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:33:\"Stack Selection and Delivery Plan\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:148:\"We recommend WordPress, WooCommerce, React, Next.js, or a hybrid approach based on product complexity, editorial needs, and total cost of ownership.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:19:\"Agile Build Sprints\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:149:\"Development proceeds in short sprints with demos, backlog control, and Git-based versioning so stakeholders can review working software continuously.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:27:\"Integrations and Data Flows\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:149:\"We connect payment gateways, CRMs, ERPs, shipping providers, and internal APIs, then validate edge cases around currency, tax, and bilingual content.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:37:\"QA, Security, and Performance Testing\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:149:\"Cross-browser checks, load scenarios, vulnerability hardening, accessibility basics, and Core Web Vitals validation happen before production cutover.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:28:\"Staged Deployment and Launch\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:123:\"We release through staging environments with caching, SSL, CDN, monitoring, and rollback plans so go-live stays controlled.\";}i:6;a:2:{s:10:\"step_title\";s:34:\"Support and Continuous Improvement\";s:9:\"step_desc\";s:144:\"After launch we monitor stability, ship improvements, and expand features as commercial priorities evolve across Dubai and wider UAE operations.\";}}'),
('1310','18','svc_faqs','a:14:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"What do web development services in Dubai typically include?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:369:\"<p>Professional web development services Dubai engagements usually cover architecture, custom theme or application build, integrations, performance work, security hardening, QA, deployment, and handover documentation. Many projects also include bilingual EN/AR implementation, UAE payment gateways, and post-launch maintenance so the platform stays secure and fast.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:66:\"Should my business choose WordPress or a custom React application?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:368:\"<p>WordPress is the right default for most content-led Dubai business sites because editors can publish quickly and SEO foundations are strong. React or Next.js becomes valuable when you need app-like interaction, complex dashboards, or high-scale dynamic interfaces. We often recommend hybrid models when marketing pages and application views have different jobs.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"Can you integrate UAE payment gateways and BNPL options?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:300:\"<p>Yes. We regularly integrate PayFort, Telr, Network International, Stripe, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and buy-now-pay-later options such as tabby and Tamara. Checkout design and technical reliability both matter, so payment work is tested across devices and failure states, not only the happy path.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"How do you approach website security for UAE companies?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:343:\"<p>Security includes HTTPS enforcement, least-privilege access, hardened admin workflows, dependency updates, firewall rules, malware scanning, and backup recovery tests. Ecommerce and lead platforms get additional controls around form abuse and sensitive data handling. We also help teams operate in line with practical PDPL expectations.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:54:\"What hosting setup do you recommend for Dubai traffic?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:331:\"<p>For many high-traffic platforms we favour cloud infrastructure with strong regional latency characteristics, paired with Cloudflare CDN caching. Managed WordPress hosts can be ideal for editorial sites. Where data residency matters, we evaluate UAE-compatible options. Shared hosting is avoided for revenue-critical systems.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:60:\"Can you rebuild an ecommerce store without disrupting sales?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:322:\"<p>Yes, through staged migration. We clone catalogue structures, map URLs, preserve SEO metadata, test checkout thoroughly, and cut over during a controlled window. Inventory sync, payment verification, and redirect QA are non-negotiable. A careful rebuild should improve reliability rather than create downtime drama.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:62:\"Do you develop Arabic and English sites with full RTL support?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:294:\"<p>Yes. Bilingual development is a core capability. We implement directional layout support, Arabic typography stacks, language-aware routing or hreflang, and CMS workflows that let teams edit each language safely. RTL bugs are caught in QA rather than discovered by customers after launch.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:61:\"How long does a custom web development project take in Dubai?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:280:\"<p>A standard corporate WordPress build often lands in 6 to 10 weeks. Ecommerce platforms, multi-system integrations, or React applications commonly take 12 to 20 weeks or longer. Scope clarity, content readiness, and third-party API access are the biggest timeline variables.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:43:\"How do you keep websites fast after launch?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:311:\"<p>Performance is engineered in the build through efficient queries, image strategy, caching, code splitting where relevant, and CDN delivery. After launch we monitor Core Web Vitals and regressive plugin or content changes. Fast sites stay fast only when governance exists around updates and media uploads.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:58:\"Can development work support SEO and AI search visibility?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:390:\"<p>Absolutely. Clean architecture, crawlable rendering, structured data, logical internal linking, and fast pages all support organic growth. We collaborate with <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">search engine optimisation</a> and <a href=\"/services/ai-search-optimization/\">AI search optimisation</a> so technical decisions reinforce discoverability rather than fight it.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"Do you offer ongoing maintenance after the project ends?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:297:\"<p>Yes. Retainers typically cover core and plugin updates, uptime monitoring, backups, security checks, performance reviews, and a pool of development hours. Business-critical platforms should never rely on occasional emergency fixes alone. Continuous care is cheaper than preventable outages.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:42:\"Can you work from an existing design file?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:344:\"<p>Yes. We implement Figma or equivalent design systems with fidelity and practical engineering judgment. If you need design and build together, our <a href=\"/services/web-design/\">web design</a> team can lead UX/UI before development. Either way, handoff quality determines how accurately the final product matches the intended experience.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:63:\"What makes a development partner suitable for Dubai businesses?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:328:\"<p>Local commercial context matters: bilingual journeys, UAE payments, mobile-heavy traffic, and high expectations around polish and uptime. A strong partner explains trade-offs clearly, documents systems, and builds for operations, not only launch day demos. That is how platforms remain useful as teams and campaigns grow.</p>\";}i:13;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"How do we start a web development engagement?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:271:\"<p>Share your current stack, must-have integrations, traffic profile, and commercial goals. We respond with recommended architecture, delivery phases, and investment ranges. <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a> to schedule a technical discovery call with no obligation.</p>\";}}'),
('1311','18','svc_technologies','a:10:{i:0;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:9:\"WordPress\";}i:1;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:11:\"WooCommerce\";}i:2;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"React\";}i:3;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:7:\"Next.js\";}i:4;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"PHP 8\";}i:5;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:5:\"MySQL\";}i:6;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:18:\"AWS / DigitalOcean\";}i:7;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:14:\"Cloudflare CDN\";}i:8;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:12:\"Git / GitHub\";}i:9;a:1:{s:9:\"tech_name\";s:8:\"REST API\";}}'),
