('1343','17','service_faqs_10_question','Will my team be able to update the site without designers?'),
('1344','17','service_faqs_10_answer','<p>Yes, when we design within a CMS-friendly system such as WordPress. Editable regions, reusable blocks, and clear component rules help marketing teams update copy and media safely. We also provide handoff guidance so day-to-day edits do not erode spacing, hierarchy, or brand consistency.</p>'),
