('1347','17','service_faqs_11_question','Do you handle both design and development?'),
('1348','17','service_faqs_11_answer','<p>Yes. Many projects move from UX/UI into implementation through our <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development services</a>. Keeping design and build under one strategy reduces lost fidelity, performance gaps, and bilingual layout issues that often appear when teams work in isolation.</p>'),
