('1351','17','service_faqs_12_question','How luxury should a Dubai website look?'),
('1352','17','service_faqs_12_answer','<p>Luxury in Dubai digital design usually means clarity, restraint, strong craft, and confident whitespace rather than heavy ornament. Visitors should feel quality immediately through typography, photography direction, pacing, and interaction polish. Gimmicks fade quickly. Purposeful elegance converts better and ages better.</p>'),
