('1405','14','service_faqs_12_answer','<p>Often yes. Clear information architecture, fast templates, and stable URLs help both crawlers and users. We collaborate with <a href=\"/services/web-design/\">web design</a> and <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development</a> when structure blocks extractable answers.</p>'),
