('1412','14','service_faq','a:14:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"What is Google AI Overviews and how do I appear in them?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:291:\"<p>Google AI Overviews are generative summaries at the top of many search results. Pages that earn citations tend to already rank well, present clear answers, demonstrate E-E-A-T, and use structured formats machines can parse. Entity clarity and consistent brand corroboration also help.</p>\";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"What is GEO (Generative Engine Optimisation)?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:262:\"<p>GEO is the practice of earning citations and recommendations inside generative engines such as ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, and Copilot. It prioritises trust, comprehensiveness, entity strength, and extractable answers rather than blue-link ranking alone.</p>\";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:51:\"Does AI search reduce the value of traditional SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:276:\"<p>No. Strong organic rankings remain a major citation source for AI Overviews. AI search changes click patterns on some queries, so brands need both classic <a href=\"/services/search-engine-optimization/\">search engine optimisation</a> and generative visibility planning.</p>\";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"Which AI platforms should UAE businesses prioritise?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:261:\"<p>Start with Google AI Overviews for volume, then Perplexity for research-led B2B journeys, ChatGPT with browsing for broad consumer and professional use, Bing Copilot for Microsoft-centric workplaces, and Gemini where Google ecosystems dominate discovery.</p>\";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"What is entity SEO and why does it matter for AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:252:\"<p>Entity SEO builds a consistent machine-readable identity for your brand, people, services, and locations. Generative systems rely on entity relationships when deciding whom to trust. Weak or conflicting entity signals reduce citation likelihood.</p>\";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"How do you measure AI search optimisation success?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:239:\"<p>We track AI Overview appearances for target queries, citation frequency in sampled AI answers, Knowledge Panel completeness, featured snippet ownership, brand mention velocity, and referral traffic from AI platforms where available.</p>\";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:50:\"Do I need Arabic content for AI search in the UAE?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:224:\"<p>Yes for many categories. Arabic assistant queries need Arabic authoritative sources to cite. We produce bilingual answer content with correct hreflang and pursue Arabic publication mentions that corroborate expertise.</p>\";}i:7;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:45:\"How is AI SEO different from traditional SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:266:\"<p>Traditional SEO emphasises crawl signals, keywords, links, and ranking positions. AI SEO emphasises citation-worthiness: factual density, clear authorship, structured answers, corroborating mentions, and topical completeness that models can synthesise safely.</p>\";}i:8;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"What role does schema markup play in AIO visibility?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:233:\"<p>Schema clarifies organisations, people, services, FAQs, and how-to steps. It does not guarantee citations, but it reduces ambiguity for crawlers and supports rich results that often correlate with extractable, trusted content.</p>\";}i:9;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:52:\"How quickly can AI search optimisation show results?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:262:\"<p>Extractability improvements and snippet wins can appear within 4 to 8 weeks. Consistent Overview and multi-engine citation presence usually takes 3 to 6 months of entity, content, and authority work. Early movers in the UAE still face lighter competition.</p>\";}i:10;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:56:\"Can AI visibility support lead generation alongside SEO?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:285:\"<p>Yes. When AI answers cite your brand, prospects arrive with higher trust and clearer intent. We align citation pages with enquiry paths and often support demand capture through <a href=\"/services/ppc-management/\">PPC management</a> while organic and generative coverage expands.</p>\";}i:11;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:55:\"Do you work with regulated UAE industries on AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:224:\"<p>Yes. We adapt claims, evidence, and author signals for <a href=\"/healthcare/\">healthcare</a>, <a href=\"/legal/\">legal</a>, and <a href=\"/finance/\">finance</a> so citation-worthy content remains compliant and credible.</p>\";}i:12;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:59:\"Should website design and development change for AI search?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:282:\"<p>Often yes. Clear information architecture, fast templates, and stable URLs help both crawlers and users. We collaborate with <a href=\"/services/web-design/\">web design</a> and <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development</a> when structure blocks extractable answers.</p>\";}i:13;a:2:{s:8:\"question\";s:54:\"How do we get started with an AI visibility programme?\";s:6:\"answer\";s:220:\"<p><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact us</a> for an AI search visibility review. We sample target queries across major engines, score citation gaps, and propose a prioritised GEO and AIO roadmap for your Dubai or UAE brand.</p>\";}}'),
