('1416','15','service_faqs_10_question','Do you set up conversion tracking correctly for UAE businesses?'),
('1417','15','service_faqs_10_answer','<p>Yes. Accurate tracking is non-negotiable. We implement Google Tag Manager, GA4 events, enhanced conversions where appropriate, CRM or call tracking for lead gen, and offline conversion imports when sales close outside the website. Without clean conversion data, Smart Bidding cannot optimise profitably.</p>'),
('1418','15','_service_faqs_10_question','field_faq_q'),
('1419','15','_service_faqs_10_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1420','15','service_faqs_11_question','Can you manage YouTube and LinkedIn ads for Dubai brands?'),
('1421','15','service_faqs_11_answer','<p>Yes. YouTube supports mid-funnel education and remarketing at scale. LinkedIn is especially effective for B2B lead generation across professional services, finance, and enterprise sales in Dubai and Abu Dhabi. We build creative, audiences, and funnel measurement for both platforms.</p>'),
('1422','15','_service_faqs_11_question','field_faq_q'),
('1423','15','_service_faqs_11_answer','field_faq_a'),
('1424','15','service_faqs_12_question','What makes SearchEngineOptimization.ae different from other PPC agencies in Dubai?'),
('1425','15','service_faqs_12_answer','<p>We combine certified paid media specialists with local UAE market knowledge, senior account ownership, and commercial reporting tied to leads and revenue, not vanity clicks. Our team works across <a href=\"/services/\">SEO, social, and web</a> so landing pages, tracking, and creative stay aligned. Review our <a href=\"/case-studies/\">case studies</a> or <a href=\"/contact/\">request a free PPC audit</a>.</p>'),
