de a detailed proposal with a fixed price, timeline, and deliverables specification. There are no hidden costs and no ongoing retainer obligations beyond the agreed project scope.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n','Web Development','Fast, secure, and scalable web development. From WordPress to custom platforms, we build digital infrastructure that performs under real-world conditions.','inherit','closed','closed','','18-revision-v1','','','2026-07-29 15:00:12','2026-07-29 15:00:12','','18','http://localhost:8000/?p=90','0','revision','','0'),
